# cine act=lesson fx="code:@bill_tape;bg:meta_el_texture_server_bokeh;lines:NEW MEXICO · 21 OCT 2026^$25,000,000,000~FTC ORDER · 2012^A PROMISE~2015 · DELETION LETTERS^NOT CHECKED~CAMBRIDGE ANALYTICA · 2018^CLOSED~STOCK MARKET · 26 JUL 2018^−$119B~UK REGULATOR · 2018^£500,000~FTC · 2019^$5,000,000,000~SEC · 2019^$100,000,000~USER CLASS ACTION · 2022^$725,000,000;new:4;go:Every;lab:EVERY ONE A RECORD;sub:every one survivable;stamp:SURVIVED;stampat:survivable;out:right"
Every one of these was a record. But every one of them was **survivable**.

