# cine act=rise fx="code:@wipe_to_photo;clip:meta_facebook_sign_reverse_sun;pic:meta_meta_sign_1_hacker_way;go:renamed;ty:.74;band:1;lab:FACEBOOK BECOMES META · 2021;sub:2025 revenue: $200.97 billion;in:right"
In twenty twenty-one, Facebook renamed itself **Meta**.
By twenty twenty-five, its yearly revenue had passed two hundred billion **dollars**.

